\description{
T2 scores how stable the forest canopy of each unit has been over recent
years. Given a FORMS-T canopy-height time series (\code{forms_t}, spec 060), it
is \strong{measured}: the share of the unit's canopy that lost at least
\code{seuil_perte} metres of height for good, whatever the cause (clear-cut,
